  "$comment": "Illustrative AI Catalog document carrying ASM value/selection metadata via a namespaced `extensions` entry. Not an official ASM<->AI-Catalog binding; a runnable demonstration that the value layer fits the upstream cross-protocol standard without core-schema changes.",
